# ===== API Base URL =====
# DEFAULT (no env needed): https://whatsapp-services-8t87.onrender.com/api  (Render backend)
#
# Agar override karna ho to ye set karo (e.g. ngrok free URL use karte waqt):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://numerate-resisting-squeamish.ngrok-free.dev/api
#
# Note: VITE_* variables build-time pe bake hote hain — Vercel me change karne
# ke baad redeploy zaroori hai. Abhi default already Render URL hai isliye bina
# env set kiye bhi kaam karega.